-- SI7-BLIZZ 29725 SI:7 Report: Fire From the Sky (Pearlfin Village): the Sully scene (The Debriefing 02) made playable along the retail mechanics.
-- (1) Sully vehicle 55286 VehicleId 1762 -> 1768: 1762 (seats 10211/10212, flags 0x200800f) has neither CAN_CONTROL nor CAN_ATTACK, so the player got no action bar and could not walk (dev sync96 test 4-11); 1768 (seat 10235, flags 0xe2100a06 = CAN_CONTROL + CAN_ATTACK, the same seat flags as 1773 that is proven for Rell 55335) is the only controllable VehicleId in the free range 1762-1768 (VehicleIds follow creature entry order: 55286 < 55305 = 1769).
-- (2) Pearlfin Sully 55282 keeps himself grid-active while the Debriefing list waits, and the teleport -> summon delay is 2500 -> 10000 ms (same fix as 29733, files 2026_11_04_06/07: a summon cast while the invoker is still loading fails).
-- (3) Light Scope (104005, spell1 of 55286) is the retail mechanic: a 1 s channel on the enemy target whose tick triggers 103866 Sniper Shot (359999 damage = Amber's shot) on the channel target; Lurking Tigers 55550 (lvl 85, Health_mod 1, about 158k hp) die from one shot. The tigers come from the retail spell 103994 "The Debriefing 02: Summon Tiger" (personal summon, 90 s, random spot up to 60 yd ahead of the caster), cast by the Sully vehicle: once after Amber takes her perch and once after Socks joins (the video shows two ambushes). The tiger loses its C++ script (npc_lurking_tiger = stealth 77806 on reset + melee) and gets the same behaviour in SmartAI, plus Sully's 54015 "Tryin' ta sneak up on ol' Sully, huh?" on aggro.
-- (4) Sully's reactions to Amber's shots (SPELLHIT_TARGET 103866 on the vehicle): 54010-54014/54016/54017 as one random group. Vehicle events fire while the player controls it only with SMART_EVENT_FLAG_WHILE_CHARMED (512).
-- (6) The shrine and camp triggers 55349-55352 reacted to any friendly unit in line of sight (OOC_LOS, noHostile): on dev 4-11 22:55 two leftover camp triggers, summoned by passing NPCs through the northern trigger of earlier runs, ended the scene right after the intro. They now react only to the Sully vehicle 55286 (DISTANCE_CREATURE 25 yd, once).
-- (5) Socks is a second 55299 raccoon (104021 Summon Raccoon is the only raccoon spell of this scene), summoned after Gizmo is shot; the camp trigger 55352 despawns itself at the end (it was left behind); back in Pearlfin Sully 55282 says 53997 (video 5:25); failsafe after 15 minutes in the vehicle: teleport back and despawn, no credit.
-- Source: 5.4.8 Spell.dbc/SpellEffect.dbc/SpellMisc.dbc (104005, 103866, 103994, 104021, 103237/103239), Vehicle.dbc/VehicleSeat.dbc 18414 (1762-1768), zone_the_jade_forest.cpp (npc_lurking_tiger, SPELL_STEALTH 77806), video https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NRy7i1oxgfg + whisper transcript ("Tryin' ta sneak up on ol' Sully"/"Nice shot, Amber" at 1:49-2:03 and 3:24-3:27, "Didn't know I had a sniper on my side" 1:33, 53997 at 5:25), broadcast_text 54010-54017/53997, creature_classlevelstats; dev tests 4-11 (sync96: no action bar and no movement with 1762).
-- DERIVED (no sniff): VehicleId 1768, the moments of the two tiger summons, the reaction lines as a random group, Socks' summon spot, failsafe 900 s, Pearlfin positions.
-- (correction 5-11-2026 02:28, dev test 29725) event_flags 512 is NOT "while charmed" on this core: SmartScriptMgr.h has no such flag, 0x200 = SMART_EVENT_FLAG_DIFFICULTY_RAID40, so flagged rows never ran on map 870. The vehicle rows below now use flags 0/1; SmartScript::ProcessEvent has no charm check, vehicle events fire while the player drives.
